# ===== Key 治理（最高优先级，宁枉勿纵）=====
# 真实密钥只允许存在于以下文件，全部拒绝入库：
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/application-dev.yml
**/application-local.yml
**/secrets/
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*credential*
**/apiKey*
**/api_key*

# ===== WorkBuddy 工作区数据（不入作品集仓库）=====
.workbuddy/

# ===== Python =====
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# ===== Java / Spring Boot =====
target/
build/
*.class
*.jar
!.mvn/wrapper/maven-wrapper.jar
.gradle/
out/
*.log
hs_err_pid*

# ===== Node（如原型含前端面板）=====
node_modules/
dist/

# ===== IDE / OS =====
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ===== 运行时产物 =====
logs/
*.pid
data/cache/
reports/local/
